    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14343" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποχωρ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>separate from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ χεῖρον ἀπὸ βελτίονος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Sph.</u>
					226d
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be separated from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					59d
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἰνῶν αἷμα ἀ.</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				84a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>separate, set apart, detach,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				16.16
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ὡς ἓν εἶδος</span>
			<i>separate and put</i> into one class, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				262e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ βασιλικῆς τε καὶ πολιτικῆς
				πράξεως</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				289d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be vomited,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Herod.
			</span></i>
			
				Med.
			 in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.Mus.</u>
				58.99
			</span></i>.</div>
